# Fetched assets, not source. `python scripts/prepare_assets.py` reproduces both from pinned
# URLs, and the packaging workflow runs it. Kept out of the repo because the FFmpeg build is an
# ~80MB platform binary and the CJK fonts are ~28MB, and neither is anything we author.
#
# If they are missing the app does not guess: the 字幕 controls disable themselves and say which
# is absent, and tests/test_subtitles.py fails rather than letting a build ship without them.
backend/vendor/
backend/src/automated_video_editing_backend/assets/fonts/
backend/src/automated_video_editing_backend/assets/semantic/

# OS/editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

